      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:expanded">
        <tei:head xml:lang="he">סידור אשכנז מורחב</tei:head>
        <tei:head xml:lang="en">Expanded Ashkenazi Siddur</tei:head>
        <tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">This edition arranges Birnbaum’s Ashkenazi prayer text in recitation order. Hebrew and English share one sequence. Set the date, place, service and minyan in the reader settings. Unresolved choices remain with their rubrics. Rosh Hashanah and Yom Kippur coverage is limited to the services and rites Birnbaum contains; use a mahzor for the remaining services.</tei:note>
